"},{"source_id":"src_2433","target_ko":"왜 내가!"},{"source_id":"src_2434","target_ko":"너 이 자식! 뭘!?"},{"source_id":"src_2435","target_ko":"하아!? 장난치지 마!"},{"source_id":"src_2436","target_ko":"벌주기……!"},{"source_id":"src_2437","target_ko":"고르지 마…"},{"source_id":"src_2438","target_ko":"아앙! 왜!?"},{"source_id":"src_2439","target_ko":"어엣, 내?"},{"source_id":"src_2440","target_ko":"뭐, 뭐야아!?"},{"source_id":"src_2441","target_ko":"사코냐!? 사코지!?"},{"source_id":"src_2442","target_ko":"어, 어떡하지…!"},{"source_id":"src_2443","target_ko":"으아앙! 사코오…!"},{"source_id":"src_2444","target_ko":"누가 해 줄 줄 알고!"},{"source_id":"src_2445","target_ko":"네가 뭔데!!"},{"source_id":"src_2446","target_ko":"흐응, 배짱 한번 좋네."},{"source_id":"src_2447","target_ko":"벌주기라…… 할 수 있다면 해 봐."},{"source_id":"src_2448","target_ko":"저, 저기…… 저……인가요?"},{"source_id":"src_2449","target_ko":"벌주기…….\n하기 싫어"},{"source_id":"src_2450","target_ko":"오늘은… 뭘 하려는 거야?"},{"source_id":"src_2451","target_ko":"나? 으, 응…"},{"source_id":"src_2452","target_ko":"뭘 할 생각이야…"},{"source_id":"src_2453","target_ko":"나냐…"},{"source_id":"src_2454","target_ko":"어떤 걸 할 거야…?"},{"source_id":"src_2455","target_ko":"불렀어…?"},{"source_id":"src_2456","target_ko":"지금부터 하는 기가…!?"},{"source_id":"src_2457","target_ko":"정말, 선생님!"},{"source_id":"src_2458","target_ko":"헤헹, 얼마든지 와!"},{"source_id":"src_2459","target_ko":"사코 차례야~?"},{"source_id":"src_2460","target_ko":"사, 살살 해 줬으면 좋겠어…"},{"source_id":"src_2461","target_ko":"유코… 맞지…?"},{"source_id":"src_2462","target_ko":"어느 걸… 할 거야?"},{"source_id":"src_2463","target_ko":"뭐, 뭔데!?"},{"source_id":"src_2464","target_ko":"시험해 줄게. 이리 와."},{"source_id":"src_2465","target_ko":"얼마나 늘었을지 기대되네."},{"source_id":"src_2466","target_ko":"나…… 힘낼게!"},{"source_id":"src_2467","target_ko":"뭐, 뭘 하는 거야……?"},{"source_id":"src_2468","target_ko":"뭐… 할까…"},{"source_id":"src_2469","target_ko":"응, 알았어"}]}
